window.products.push({"id":551009,"name":"ALLMILL Shower Curtain Floral Bird Tropical Paradise Hawaii Waterproof Bath Curtains Hooks Included - 72 x 72 inches Bathroom Decorative Ideas Polyest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wp4a+VLtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Change up the look of your bathroom with this Shower Curtain 72\" x 72\". It's made of 100 percent soft and durable polyester and is machine washable to make it easy to care for and to maintain. The easy-care fabric of this shower curtain features an eye-popping pattern. It includes reinforced holes that accommodate standard-sized hooks, which are sold separately, to make it easy to hang. It looks wonderful in your master bathroom, guest bathroom or a teen's bathroom. About the collection Fill your bath space with the vibrant colors of the season with the Refresh Bath Collection. Each piece in this decorative bath collection not only feels soft to the touch, but is also easy to clean and maintain. From hand towels and bath towels to shower curtains and bath mats, the vibrant colors and stunning patterns displayed by each piece in this collection create an eye-catching display in your bathroom. How do I clean a plastic shower curtain? You can usually clean your plastic shower curtain in the washing machine. We recommend throwing it in the wash with several bath towels and letting it air dry after. Never place it in the dryer as it will melt. Are fabric shower curtains easy to clean? Most fabric shower curtains are very easy to clean. You can place them in the washing machine and then in the dryer. Always confirm on the tag if there is a specific temperature setting you should use on the dryer. Includes 1 shower curtain (72\" H x 72\" W) Made of 100% polyester Machine wash cold and gentle cycle Tumble dry low Reinforced holes fit any standard-size hooks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wp4a+VLtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALLMILL","source_asin":"B086TZZ3YV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086TZZ3YV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086TZZ3YV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
