window.products.push({"id":551059,"name":"Luigi Bormioli Set of 4 Allegro 10-Oz. Martini Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IjBp2nyZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shake up a round of cosmopolitans or one’s own personal twist on the martini and serve to friends in this set of four 10-ounce cocktail glasses from Luigi Bormioli’s Allegro collection. Made at Luigi Bormioli’s Parma, Italy headquarters, the Allegro stemware aspires to radiate its musical namesake’s lively and cheerful qualities in its brilliant appearance and durability. Each of the sleek cocktail glasses offers a spacious mouth to sip from the almost perfect, equilateral triangle-shaped bowl. The sturdy stem tapers nicely to maintain the even conical bowl’s form, and a broad base add stability. The set reflects the Parma region’s long legacy of glass artistry and the similar repute that Luigi Bormioli has built since its 1946 inception. Though Luigi Bormioli remains committed to fabricating their stemware from the purest sands and natural ingredients while practicing time-honored glassblowing techniques, the company also embraces modern technology. The Allegro line’s makeup exemplifies this mélange of classic glasswork and forward-thinking with its use of Luigi Bormioli’s 2007 innovation of their lead-free, crystalline SON.Hyx glass. SON.Hyx’s clarity in both translucency and sonority rivals the industry standard of lead crystal. In terms of strength, SON.Hyx surpasses crystal with its greatly enhanced resilience against chips and cracks from the glass’s base, along the stem, up the sides of the bowl, and around the glass’s thin rim. Additionally, the dishwasher-safe stemware resists discoloration and sustains its original lucidity for over 400 wash cycles. Luigi Bormioli protects all Allegro products with a 25-year guarantee against discoloration and chipping along stemware rims and feet incurred during normal household usage. Each cocktail glass stands close to 8 inches high with a 9-2/5-inch circumference around the bowl’s rim. The complete set weighs 1 pound upon shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IjBp2nyZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luigi Bormioli","source_asin":"B001RIZBVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001RIZBVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001RIZBVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
