window.products.push({"id":551105,"name":"Lafuma Clipmaid Serving Tray - Anthracite","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612gTxPUCPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since 1954, Lafuma is the world leader in recliners, outdoor furniture and accessories. Lafuma products come with a 2 year warranty. Lafuma is synonymous with high-quality outdoor gear. Starting as a backpack manufacturer in the 1930s in France, Lafuma quickly expanded into a full-line outdoor company and is now Europe’s leading manufacturer of outdoor gear and apparel. Lafuma is no longer confined to the old country—the company expanded out of its playground in the French Alps and set up shop in Colorado. From the Rockies, Lafuma continues to be an innovator of lightweight, highly packable sleeping bags, multi-day and adventure race packs, trail running and hiking footwear, and top-of-the-line, premium camp chairs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612gTxPUCPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lafuma","source_asin":"B005G1L7UK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005G1L7UK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005G1L7UK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":551106,"name":"Executive Office Chair, Ergonomic Big and Tall Leather Swivel Rolling Managerial Reclining Computer Desk Task Chair, Adjustable High Back Recliner Cha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":208.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mQpnb1OUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Recline & Lock Function - The backrest can be tilted back, which helps reduce the pressure on the lower back muscles and relax the lumbar area. The recline range is 35 degrees(from 90 to 125 degrees). Plus, you can recline and lock that position at any angle within that range. Premium Leather Computer Chair - This big and tall office chair is designed to be made of bonded leather, providing comfort sitting experience. High-density headrest and backrest with built-in lumbar support, seat cushions relieve pressure from the legs while providing cushioning for long workdays. Classic pure-soft thick padded big and tall chairs, give you a cozy sitting experience for work, relaxation, and gaming. Comfortable Padded Footrest & Armrests - Our executive chair features a footrest. The retractable soft-padded footrest sits just under the seat, which adds to the overall comfort of the chair. It allows you to take a quick nap in between your games or work tasks. Besides, the padded armrests help reduce tension in the upper body and allow the shoulders to relax. Dynamic Adjustability Desk Chair - With a height adjuster, this comfortable executive chair upholstered can adjust to the height of your desk with a seat height that can be adjusted from 19.5\" to 22.4\".Features 360-degree mobility with rolling caster wheels, you can swivel to any direction whatever you like, flexible for you to deal with multi-tasking. Easy to Assemble - The heavy-duty desk chair has a 300 pounds weight capacity. With the detailed instructions and tools included in the package, you can easily assemble the chair by yourself in a short time. Get ready for your superior workspace! Satisfaction Guarantee - Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions about the chair. we dedicate ourselves to bringing a great sitting experience to all customers and offer a 12-month warranty. Item shape: L-Shaped Item shape: L-Shaped Unit count: 1.0","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mQpnb1OUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUNMOS","source_asin":"B0B49VCR21","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B49VCR21","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B49VCR21","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":551107,"name":"DERGUAM 4 Packs 100% Leakproof Champagne Stoppers Champagne Cork Champagne Saver Champagne Bottle Stoppers to Keep Champagne Fresh Perfect for Champag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gFFL83VlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: - 100% SAFE FOR YOUR HEALTH: Made of High Quality silicone. Has sleek finish and no odor.- LEAK-PROOF AIR RIGHT SEAL: Silicone seal locks in bubbles to preserve champagne’s freshness longer and keep it from going flat too quickly.- EASY TO USE & COMPACT: Insert and clip to the bottle neck. After use, washing after running water. It is compact for easy storage. Specification: - Size: 1.57*1.57*1.18 inch- Material: Food Grade Silicone and Plastic (BPA and Pthalate Free)- Color: Black How to use: - 1. Rotate the upper part anti-clockwise to UNLOCK before used.- 2. Insert firmly into the bottleneck, rotate the upper part clockwise until a click sound to LOCK the seal.- 3. To open again, unlock the stopper before removing it. Package includes: - 4 × Champagne Stoppers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gFFL83VlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeRicham","source_asin":"B086WD2CWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086WD2CWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086WD2CWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
