window.products.push({"id":551266,"name":"CHIUTUUY Insulated Tumbler with Lid and Straws, 12oz Iced Coffee Mug, Stainless Steel Double Wall Vacuum Cute Tumbler Cups for Wine, Coffee, Beverages","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+CMUFpt8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Insulated Stainless Steel】CHIUTUUY 12 oz tumbler is made of 18/8 304 food grade stainless steel with double wall vacuum technology to keep the drinks stay cold for 9+ hours or hot for 3+ hours. It's lightweight, lead-free, rust proof, sweat proof, durable and easy to wash. 【Cow Print Cup Body】The cup body features the current fashion cow print design, which will not peel and fade. It's eye-catching and great popular for those who love cow. 【BPA Free Press-in Lid】The transparent lid is BPA free, combined with a silica gasket seals to achieve maximum spill proof capability. Push the opening/closing sliding cover for a straw friendly. 【Two Straws Included】Two straws (one metal and one pink silicone) and one cleaning brush match well with the tumbler cup, adding the versatility of drinking, easy to clean, re-usable, safer and better for the environment. The silicone straw is safer for children to use. 【Perfect Capacity】The 12 oz capacity is designed especially for enjoying wine, coffee, tea, beverages and more, it is a good partner at teatime, parties and office time. It's also a great gift idea to your family and friends on a special day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+CMUFpt8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHIUTUUY","source_asin":"B0BVBX9556","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVBX9556","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVBX9556","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":551267,"name":"Modernhome 11-Piece Stainless Steel Kitchen Dessert Tool Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mlo-UdvPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Benefits  Whether you're preparing a cake from scratch, shaving truffles or chocolate for fancy toppings, or preparing and serving a cheesecake for your family and guests, no recipe is too imaginative or challenging for this 10-piece set of dessert tools and utensils. Aside from their clean looks and eye-catching modern design, each tool is made from durable stainless steel with easy-to-grip rubberized handles, giving you an extra edge of confidence with every new creation. Beat eggs with ease, spread icing and toppings on cakes and pastries evenly, curl butter for accents and recipes, or cut and dice fruits and ingredients for pies; the possibilities are literally endless. And once you've finished serving up that perfect dessert, the entire set is dishwasher safe for nearly effortless cleanup. Function  The Modernhome 10 Piece Dessert Utensil Set contains all of the essential tools needed to prepare virtually any dessert you can dream up. Each set includes a total of 10 stainless steel dessert tools with large rubberized handles, including slotted and silicone spatulas, cutting, serving and paring knives, butter-curling tool, and a shaver for chocolate, cheese or truffles. As part of the 10 piece set, there's also a modern display stand for hanging them once you've cleaned or removed them from the dishwasher. • Includes whisk, grated spatula, icing spatula, butter curler, strainer, cheese & chocolate shaver, 2 knives, pie cutter and decorative stand • Constructed from durable brushed stainless steel with black accents for a clean and modern look • Special rubberized-grips make each of these dessert utensils easy and fun to use • Comes with its own hanging utensil stand for display on counters or dessert prep areas • All utensils are dishwasher-safe for fast and mess-free cleanup","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mlo-UdvPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modernhome","source_asin":"B00K6B2BRS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K6B2BRS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K6B2BRS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
