window.products.push({"id":551437,"name":"YEBODA 32oz Glass Milk Bottle with Plastic Tamper-proof Caps (4 Pack) Vintage Reusable Dairy Drinking Containers, Glass Bottles for Milk, Juice,Yogurt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GWDr4Gt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality】: 32oz glass milk bottles are made of pure glass material which is extremely safe, PBA, and lead free which is a great alternative to acrylic and plastic bottles. Unlike plastic, our milk bottle won’t leach BPA or phthalates into your food. Our glass bottles are also recyclable and reusable. By using our milk bottles you’ll help reduce toxic emissions, overall benefiting the environment. 【Multiple Usages 】: Vintage dairy bottles are wonderful for shakes, smoothies, plain water, milk, juices or cocktails as beverage, glassware or drinkware. Perfectly for BBQs, garden parties, weddings, picnics and beach trips. You can take them anywhere as great gifts with a real talking point! Also, you can use them simply as decoration. The possibilities are endless! 【Tamper-proof caps】: Our tamper-proof caps are flexible and crack-resistant. Designed with a security ring, you’ll know right away if the glass bottle has been opened already. The lip on the lid makes it easy to remove our push-on cap. The tight sealed closure prevents accidental leaks and spills which also keeps bad-odors from permeating the contents of the glass bottle. However, we insist on recommending hand-wash for the lids . 【Valuable Package】: Each milk bottle with lids are super smooth and wide-mouth for dishwasher-safe packaged in bubble wrap sleeves to prevent the breakage of our glass bottle milk during the shipping. The set includes 4 top quality glass bottles, 4 reusable white lids, additional 4 black lids that can bring more value to your family and friends in any occasion. 【Satisfied Guarantee】: Good customer satisfaction is our final goal. We are committed to offer you risk-free. If some glas bottles are cracked, broken or you have any issues and suggestions, please fell free to let us know so that we can do our best to make sure you are 100% satisfied with our product and service. We will be on-line 24hours all day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GWDr4Gt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEBODA","source_asin":"B09ST5NH4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ST5NH4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ST5NH4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
