window.products.push({"id":551585,"name":"5 Pcs Kitchen Fine Tweezer Tongs, Stainless Steel Food Tweezers Set, Professional Kitchen Long Tweezer for Cooking,Repairing,Sea food,BBQ,Multi-use(12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hv39MDfxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL: Extend your reach in the kitchen with the new 12” extra-long, precision tweezers by your trusted hand in the kitchen for cooking, roasting, and plating, that will stand the test of time when exposed to heat, liquid, and awesomeness. Cook and plate with confidence with the High-Precision Professional Tweezers. HE SECRECT OF PROFESSIONAL CHEF: This set includes 5 different designs of 12 \"and 6.3\" tweezers for your daily needs.They are suitable for Food styling,plating small and delicate foods like caviar, kernels of corn, pine nuts and cranberries. The long tweezers are perfect for grilling and flipping food in BBQ. THE MOST THOUGHTFUL DESIGN: Featuring a refined grip , strategically and thoughtfully engraved on either side of the stainless-steel exterior to ensure maximum grip and sturdy hold, with additional interior micro-teeth embedded in the tips that are specifically engineered and optimized to hold even the most delicate, intricate, and slip-easy foods. MULTIFUNCTIONAL, MULTI-PURPOSE: It is essential to keep a professional set of food tweezers in your kitchen. It can help you a lot in cooking.Make it outstanding in any kitchen, not only for kitchen, cooking, baking, grilling; also suitable for gardening, aquarium plant tools, etc. YOU'LL LOVE IT: No one is born to be a good cook, but good kitchenware often gets twice the result with half the effort.This stainless steel high-precision professional tweezer works great with other kitchen items for cooking and plating with confidence. It is now considered a popular item for restaurant cookware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hv39MDfxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangoowal","source_asin":"B09NB8FDSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NB8FDSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NB8FDSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
