window.products.push({"id":551640,"name":"Belle Maison Jeweled and Colored Stones Picture Frame Photo Frame Metal Pewter Tone 4 by 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uOi8Z2B-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Your favorite photos deserve a special frame – and the Belle Maison Jeweled and Colored Stones Picture Frame / Photo Frame 4 x 6 is exactly that. Available in a variety of ornate designs with colorful faceted jewels, vintage-inspired stones, and decorative patterns, this frame serves as the perfect way to make any photo stand out. Detailed with a two-way easel stand on the back that allows you to display vertical or horizontal photos, this 4 in. x 6 in. photo frame adds elegance, sophistication, and a touch of vintage charm to any interior space. Choose from a range of colors and finishes to coordinate or contrast with other decorative accents in your home. The antique bronze finish features alternating round and rectangular faceted stones in a dark shade of indigo placed in ornately detailed settings and offset with sparkling clear jewels. A blue color combination is trimmed with solid, hollow, and concave circles accented with swirled details, faceted jewels, and clear stones. An assorted color combination offers a variety of different looks in shades of blue, including one that features a single row of faceted indigo stones with clear crystal stations that give it a vintage, art deco look. The variety of colors and designs makes it difficult to choose just one frame but makes it easy to pair any of these frames with other frames from the Jewel Collection. Combine different frames to create an interesting, chic look on any tabletop, bedside table, or book shelf. On a shelf with an assortment of other frames, these designs can also be beautifully coordinated with simple metal frames in gold or silver finishes to create texture and convey the idea that you have been collecting vintage frames over the years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uOi8Z2B-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parisian Home","source_asin":"B00M3ENU9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M3ENU9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M3ENU9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
