window.products.push({"id":551740,"name":"Y DRINK Stylish Cocktail Shaker - Double Wall Stainless Steel with Strainer - Drink Mixer - Screw-On Easy Grip Lid - Leak Proof Design - Condensation ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xr85L892L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WE WANT YOU TO SHAKE IT LIKE YOU MEAN IT A good cold Bradford to evoke Bond and that crisp shaken martini. An ice-cold mango daiquiri to summon up sunsets on tropical beaches. If you like pina Coladas and getting caught in the rain. You need a really good drink mixer shaker to help you shake, shake, shake senora, shake your body line. Bacchus, Roman god of wine, would approve of this liquor shaker and strainer. The alcohol mixer comes in food grade 18/8 304 stainless steel, for the utmost in hygiene and food safety. The built-in strainer and 2 silicone seals help you create the most ambrosial concoctions this side of the Copacabana. The screw-on easy-grip lid has a twist-on feature for effortless lid removal. That means you can whip up the perfect G&T in this cocktail mixer shaker at your next gin-and-spa party (hey, it could be a thing!), then twist off the cap to pour the tonic into the tumblers with panache. You go, you. WHAT’S INCLUDED: (1) Cocktail Shaker PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Dimensions: 3.3\" x 10\" Inches Materials: 18/8 304 Stainless Steel Volume: Total internal volume 24oz-700ml / Useable (base) volume = 17oz-500ml  Colors:  Hurricane Black  Silver Fox  Aqua Punch  Mint Splice  Coral Splash  Blush Rose Gold BAR APPEAL AT HOME.. BY THE BEACH OR POOL SIDE This DESIGN PATENTED bar shaker is packed with useful features. The built-in strainer does away with the need for a separate set of drink accessories. The screw-on easy-grip lid leads to effortless lid removal. Our colorful variants are powder coated for a comfortable non-slip grip. Inside the shaker for alcoholic drinks, meanwhile, is a double-walled insulated feature to keep ice cubes solid while you shake away. This ​durable shaker for cocktails has a condensation-free base section, meaning it won't transfer the chill to your hands while you shake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xr85L892L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Y DRINK","source_asin":"B08KSYT8CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-551740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KSYT8CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KSYT8CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
